:"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T02:49:47-08:00","id":4931,"title":"","content":"Size 8? A Polar Bear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T19:23:19-08:00","id":7146,"title":"","content":"Changing Breeds, unfortunateky, gives us only ranges:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 5-6 = Man-sized (Cougar, Ape, Condor, Deer)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 6-8 = Large (Horse, Bear, Dolphin, Komodo Dragon)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 9-13 = Heavy (Cattle, Moose, Bull Seal)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 11-15 = Huge Animal (Elephant, Hippo, Sea Lion, Orca)</span></span><br /> <br /> Here are some example Sizes given in the Corebooks (collected to gether by ... somebody, once, and noted down by me a while back):<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 7- Grizzly Bear, Motorcycle, Horse, Canoe</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 8- Bank vault door, Steel lamp post, Clydesdale, Subcompact car, Inflatable boat, Day Sailer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Size 9- Compact car, Hippo, Forklift, Fishing boat</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","name":"MugaSofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar877_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T19:45:19-08:00","id":7153,"title":"","content":"I forgot how bad the depths of CB was. Komodo Dragons in the same bracket as bears?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T06:21:53-08:00","id":73685,"title":"","content":"For reference, this is size 8:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.polarbear-facts.co.uk/pictures/polar-bear-size.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T10:00:10-08:00","id":73769,"title":"","con